===

title: beginning
---
...
Having finished reminiscing about the life you never lived, you close your eyes and prepare for your imminent death.
<<pausemusic YarnCommands>>
…
…
“No.”
<<picture YarnCommands intro_2>>
<<playmusic YarnCommands intro>>
“I don't like this ending.”
A faint voice echoes within you.
Buried beneath the despair, something still remains.
A flicker.
A spark.
A will to live.
Yes...
There's still hope.
There's still a way.
There's no way you will end it like this.
You move your hand.
Then your arm.
Slowly, painfully, you force yourself onto your feet.
You reach for the lantern.
Its light is faint.
But it is enough.
You take your first step.
<<picture YarnCommands intro_3>>
And begin your journey to the Sanctuary.
<<pausemusic YarnCommands>>
<<sfx YarnCommands startjourney>>
<<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>>
<<flash_to_black YarnCommands 4 3>>
<<load_map_scene>>

===